{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351080/extras/intellica_gif_small.gif?t=1742352981\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Intellica   believes\u00a0that positivity and happiness are the keys to self-sustaining thinking programs.\u00a0By taking part in the A.M.T. Study, you can help make it happen!</strong></i>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>QUALIA</strong> is a retro-inspired Interactive Fiction text game where you analyze and categorize two participants based on their responses to a series of questions. Are they really human? Are you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Remember,\u00a0the A.M.T.\u00a0Study is not a measurement of intelligence, but a questionnaire designed to determine the ability of an AI to be able to convincingly appear as a human. It is up to you to decide whether or not the participants are Human or Artificial.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351080/extras/qualia_spin_tiny.gif?t=1742352981\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>featuring...</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 endings!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">over 20,000 words!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">over 300 possible unique playthroughs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">audio visual media to satisfy your senses!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">the weight of extreme existential dread!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">clinically insane levels of world-building for a short text-based game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">retro aesthetic for anyone born before 1984 to feel nostalgic for!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">educational lore!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">one jumpscare!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ambition far beyond the dev's reasonable means!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351080/extras/flesh_made_white_transparent_steam.png?t=1742352981\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(:</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3351080?t=1742352981","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351080/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742352981","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351080/efcf3889870b0bde4b4b7ed00a83d643ac0027fd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742352981","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351080/efcf3889870b0bde4b4b7ed00a83d643ac0027fd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742352981","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Mature philosophical and existential themes, suicidal ideation, abuse and death of a computer program"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351080/extras/intellica_gif_small.gif?t=1742352981\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Intellica   believes\u00a0that positivity and happiness are the keys to self-sustaining thinking programs.\u00a0By taking part in the A.M.T. Study, you can help make it happen!</strong></i>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>QUALIA</strong> is a retro-inspired Interactive Fiction text game where you analyze and categorize two participants based on their responses to a series of questions. Are they really human? Are you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Remember,\u00a0the A.M.T.\u00a0S